{"steam_appid":3720460,"steam_name":"KEEP GAMBLING","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3720460/1112539392/a85b79569a08767204d5e2efb5239ef139bfcec3/1765501220/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765502339","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257247814/f7468b0d3c78a6ef197c1011a1ac13006a44f19a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1765502339","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720460/09448e502d8d5e7c30267278c25dfaf035fdde7d/ss_09448e502d8d5e7c30267278c25dfaf035fdde7d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1778184257","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720460/93d11bca0eb832a146269293a0788d37b26e0dca/ss_93d11bca0eb832a146269293a0788d37b26e0dca.1920x1080.jpg?t=1778184257","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720460/9f600ec3a1bf3c83e1b365dfc2f7368637195247/ss_9f600ec3a1bf3c83e1b365dfc2f7368637195247.1920x1080.jpg?t=1778184257","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720460/8ccf2a89a200ae37841362bc292fec51142a7691/ss_8ccf2a89a200ae37841362bc292fec51142a7691.1920x1080.jpg?t=1778184257","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720460/2aeafb78d79fb8a7d9afb4805617a7ac53df649d/ss_2aeafb78d79fb8a7d9afb4805617a7ac53df649d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1778184257"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEEP GAMBLING</strong> is a hostile friendslop gamble-em-up where you and your friends gamble hard, overdose often, and sabotage each other to be the first outta debt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720460/extras/faf9d6252527da41e8858b93e62f16d6.poster.avif?t=1778184257\" width=1170 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720460/extras/faf9d6252527da41e8858b93e62f16d6.webm?t=1778184257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720460/extras/faf9d6252527da41e8858b93e62f16d6.mp4?t=1778184257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>💥 MULTIPLAYER CHAOS </strong>- Compete or cooperate with up to 4 friends to get rich quick.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎰 <strong>LOTTO TICKET SIMULATION</strong> - Hyper-realistic lotto tickets with holographic effects, grime, and foil dust that make every scratch feel filthy and addictive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎲 <strong>SLOTS &amp; CASE OPENING</strong> - Spin reels in a back-alley club and crack open digital weapon cases at a dingy basement LAN party. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >❤️ <strong>PUMP YOUR HEART RATE</strong> - SMASH and SLAM your heart with energy drinks and stimulants. The faster it beats, the luckier you get, until…</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💔 <strong>OVERDOSE</strong> - Push too far and your heart gives out, cutting your momentum and dropping you flat. Take a breather, revive, and get back in the action!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>MAKE CASH FAST. SABOTAGE YOUR FRIENDS. CLEAR YOUR DEBT. KEEP GAMBLING</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720460/extras/5e5760988487c78466bf9906f44686f5.poster.avif?t=1778184257\" width=1170 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720460/extras/5e5760988487c78466bf9906f44686f5.webm?t=1778184257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720460/extras/5e5760988487c78466bf9906f44686f5.mp4?t=1778184257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-8700K (or equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6GB (or equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-12700K (or equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 (or equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Use of an SSD is recommended.</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Indie","Simulation"],"developers":["WIRED FEELINGS"],"publishers":["WIRED FEELINGS"],"release_date":"16 Dec, 2025"}